{"version":1,"key":"card:141","content":{"id":141,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JavaScript 中存在一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"typeof","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 操作符，通过它可以知道值的类型，TypeScript 中存在同样的一个操作符 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"typeof","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它的作用也是通过值来获取其类型，不过这里类型是 TypeScript 的类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const str = \"Hello World\";\ntype Str = typeof str; // \"Hello World\"","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"65f0abe7-640b-48a6-bba1-3065296212ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.3pagnzjqba60.png","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.3pagnzjqba60.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"typeof","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 尽可能会推导最精确的类型，如上就推导为了字面量类型，如果将上面的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 改为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"let","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么会被推导为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"let str = \"Hello World\";\ntype Str = typeof str; // string","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"52984218-4214-48f0-a161-5f20d82c744e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/类型操作"],"createTime":1689609621440,"updateTime":1754032691620,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1754032691620}}